Description: Tools for handling, processing, and analyzing species
    geographic distributions, environmental data, and biodiversity
    patterns across geographical, environmental, and attribute spaces.
    Includes functions for constructing and analyzing species
    distributions, estimating geographic ranges from occurrence
    records, and conducting spatial analyses in macroecology.
    See Vilela and Villalobos (2015) <doi:10.1111/2041-210X.12401>
    and Vilela et al. (2026) <doi:10.1111/2041-210X.70421>
    for details.
